<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en-US"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v3"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3369912927"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1893089382"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="1989 (feat. Fly By Midnight)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Nightly / Fly By Midnight"/><amll:meta key="album" value="1989 (feat. Fly By Midnight)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:05.644"><div begin="00:04.843" end="02:59.333"><p begin="00:04.843" end="00:07.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I still see your face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍能看见你的脸庞</span></p><p begin="00:08.992" end="00:12.008" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Every time that record plays<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当那熟悉的旋律响起</span></p><p begin="00:13.708" end="00:17.309" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Singing Bad Blood and Wildest Dreams<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻唱着Bad Blood和Wildest Dreams</span></p><p begin="00:19.245" end="00:21.912" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">You were looking right at me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的目光只为我停留</span></p><p begin="00:23.137" end="00:25.536" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">And I hate that now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我痛恨如今</span></p><p begin="00:25.988" end="00:28.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">I can't listen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已无法再聆听</span></p><p begin="00:28.254" end="00:31.488" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Without falling all over again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法自拔</span></p><p begin="00:31.853" end="00:33.637" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Somewhere, I'm still<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">某个角落 我依然</span></p><p begin="00:33.847" end="00:38.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Singing loud, windows down, in the back of your car<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你的车后座放声歌唱 车窗摇下</span></p><p begin="00:38.754" end="00:43.269" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">With your hands on my mouth and the radio on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的手轻捂我的唇 收音机开着</span></p><p begin="00:43.588" end="00:47.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Now it's quiet every time that I drive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今每次我开车时 都如此安静</span></p><p begin="00:47.421" end="00:52.602" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">I lost you and 1989<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我失去了你 和1989</span></p><p begin="01:00.793" end="01:05.319" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L13">I've tried cutting the cord off the speakers<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾试图剪断音箱的线</span></p><p begin="01:05.517" end="01:09.633" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L14">I've died reliving you through the songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在歌中重温你 让我痛苦不堪</span></p><p begin="01:09.949" end="01:15.699" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L15">So please excuse my aversion, 'cause not even her version<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以请原谅我的抗拒 因为即使是她的版本</span></p><p begin="01:15.699" end="01:19.266" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16">Don't hurt when it comes back on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当它再次响起时 依然让我心痛</span></p><p begin="01:19.501" end="01:21.250" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17">I swear I'm still<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我发誓我仍静立原地</span></p><p begin="01:21.497" end="01:26.015" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Singing loud, windows down, in the back of your car<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你的车后座放声歌唱 车窗摇下</span></p><p begin="01:26.183" end="01:30.901" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">With your hands on my mouth and the radio on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的手轻捂我的唇 收音机开着</span></p><p begin="01:31.050" end="01:34.599" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Now it's quiet every time that I drive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今每次我开车时 都如此安静</span></p><p begin="01:34.860" end="01:40.333" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">I lost you and 1989<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我失去了你 和1989</span></p><p begin="01:50.086" end="01:52.317" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L22">Sunsets, no rest<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日落永不停歇</span></p><p begin="01:52.446" end="01:54.599" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L23">Singing loud as you can<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾尽情高歌</span></p><p begin="01:54.734" end="01:56.983" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L24">Still in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍旧萦绕在我心间</span></p><p begin="01:57.163" end="01:59.383" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L25">I don't wanna forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿遗忘</span></p><p begin="01:59.567" end="02:01.767" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L26">Each night, you said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每夜你曾低语</span></p><p begin="02:01.949" end="02:04.282" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L27">"Are you missing me yet?"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可曾想起我？</span></p><p begin="02:04.302" end="02:06.550" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L28">You're in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你常驻我心间</span></p><p begin="02:06.682" end="02:09.333" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L29">I don't wanna forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿遗忘</span></p><p begin="02:11.285" end="02:15.949" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L30">Singing loud, windows down, in the back of your car<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你的车后座放声歌唱 车窗摇下</span></p><p begin="02:16.267" end="02:20.717" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L31">With your hands on my mouth and the radio on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的手轻捂我的唇 收音机开着</span></p><p begin="02:20.949" end="02:24.549" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L32">Now it's quiet every time that I drive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今每次我开车时 都如此安静</span></p><p begin="02:24.764" end="02:30.082" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">I lost you and 1989<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我失去了你 和1989</span></p><p begin="02:30.367" end="02:32.650" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L34">Sunsets, no rest<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日落永不停歇</span></p><p begin="02:32.815" end="02:34.983" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L35">Singing loud as you can<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾尽情高歌</span></p><p begin="02:35.199" end="02:37.431" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L36">Still in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍旧萦绕在我心间</span></p><p begin="02:37.599" end="02:39.717" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L37">I don't wanna forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿遗忘</span></p><p begin="02:39.967" end="02:42.101" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L38">Each night, you said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每夜你曾低语</span></p><p begin="02:42.317" end="02:44.466" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L39">"Are you missing me yet?"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可曾想起我？</span></p><p begin="02:44.698" end="02:46.901" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L40">You're in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你常驻我心间</span></p><p begin="02:47.101" end="02:49.583" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L41">I don't wanna forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿遗忘</span></p><p begin="02:51.899" end="02:54.565" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L42">I don't wanna forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿遗忘</span></p><p begin="02:56.567" end="02:59.333" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L43">I don't wanna forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿遗忘</span></p></div></body></tt>